{"path":"utility/variadic/va_copy","title":"va_copy","titleHtml":"va_copy","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/utility/variadic/va_copy","section":"utility","kind":"page","summary":"The va_copy macro copies src to dest.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/cstdarg\">&lt;cstdarg&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">void</span> va_copy<span class=\"br0\">(</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"kw4\">va_list</span> dest, std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"kw4\">va_list</span> src <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>The <code>va_copy</code> macro copies <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">src</span></code> to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">dest</span></code>.\n</p><p><span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variadic/va_end\">va_end</a></span> should be called on <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">dest</span></code> before the function returns or any subsequent re-initialization of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">dest</span></code> (via calls to <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variadic/va_start\">va_start</a></span> or <span class=\"t-lc\"><strong class=\"selflink\">va_copy</strong></span>).\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> dest\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> an instance of the <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variadic/va_list\">va_list</a></span> type to initialize\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> src\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> the source <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variadic/va_list\">va_list</a></span> that will be used to initialize <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">dest</span></code>\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Expanded_value\">Expanded value</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;cmath&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;cstdarg&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">double</span> sample_stddev<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span> count, ...<span class=\"br0\">)</span> \n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">double</span> sum <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"kw4\">va_list</span> args1<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variadic/va_start\"><span class=\"kw965\">va_start</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>args1, count<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"kw4\">va_list</span> args2<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    va_copy<span class=\"br0\">(</span>args2, args1<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">for</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span> i <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> i <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> count<span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"sy2\">++</span>i<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"kw4\">double</span> num <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variadic/va_arg\"><span class=\"kw966\">va_arg</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>args1, <span class=\"kw4\">double</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n        sum <span class=\"sy2\">+</span><span class=\"sy1\">=</span> num<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variadic/va_end\"><span class=\"kw967\">va_end</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>args1<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">double</span> mean <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> sum <span class=\"sy2\">/</span> count<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"kw4\">double</span> sum_sq_diff <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">for</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span> i <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> i <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> count<span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"sy2\">++</span>i<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"kw4\">double</span> num <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variadic/va_arg\"><span class=\"kw966\">va_arg</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>args2, <span class=\"kw4\">double</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n        sum_sq_diff <span class=\"sy2\">+</span><span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span>num <span class=\"sy2\">-</span> mean<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy2\">*</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span>num <span class=\"sy2\">-</span> mean<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variadic/va_end\"><span class=\"kw967\">va_end</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>args2<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/math/sqrt\"><span class=\"kw1336\">std::<span class=\"me2\">sqrt</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>sum_sq_diff <span class=\"sy2\">/</span> count<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> \n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1774\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> sample_stddev<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">4</span>, <span class=\"nu16\">25.0</span>, <span class=\"nu16\">27.3</span>, <span class=\"nu16\">26.9</span>, <span class=\"nu16\">25.7</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>0.920258</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variadic/va_start\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>va_start</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  enables access to variadic function arguments <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function macro)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variadic/va_arg\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>va_arg</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  accesses the next variadic function argument <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function macro)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variadic/va_end\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>va_end</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  ends traversal of the variadic function arguments <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function macro)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div class=\"t-dsc-see\"><span><a href=\"/w/c/variadic/va_copy\">C documentation</a></span> for <span class=\"t-dsc-see-tt\"><span>va_copy</span></span></div>\n</td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Expanded value","id":"Expanded_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"utility","title":"Utility library"},{"path":"utility/variadic","title":"Variadic functions"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"va_copy","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++11. The va_copy macro copies src to dest."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"dest, src"},{"label":"Expanded value","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"va_start","note":"enables access to variadic function arguments"},{"label":"va_arg","note":"accesses the next variadic function argument"},{"label":"va_end","note":"ends traversal of the variadic function arguments"}]}]},"standards":["C++11"],"wordCount":202,"codeBlockCount":2}
